{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uncle Ted has been training Ali in the art of herding on their Yorkshire farm, which happens to come very handy when the zombie\u00a0apocalypse\u00a0arrives on their doorstep! Zombie dog combines strategic coordination and timing with puzzle solving and comedic physics-based mayhem through its unique zombie herding mechanic. Travelling across country, coast and town Ali and their dog must combine their herding skills with a variety of environmental\u00a0traps and zombie mashing mechanics to dispatch the horde.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gain style points and complete challenges to earn \u2018bones\u2019 to spend on the skills tree.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect additional pickups to gain trophies for the farmhouse mantlepiece.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Perfect your timing in order to rise up to \u2018top dog\u2019 on the leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574550/extras/ZDog_Rolling.gif?t=1741888168\" />\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Key Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is played by using traditional sheepdog commands \u2013 minutes to learn, but a lifetime to master!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strategic mayhem, dark humour, Yorkshire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Framed by a graphic novel style narrative.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3574550?t=1741888168","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574550/d69f36ddd5868b9793f6d7e443935348a92649c3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741888168","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574550/036c0c0602823d612f6e985071d5bc84ffe6f21a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741888168","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574550/036c0c0602823d612f6e985071d5bc84ffe6f21a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741888168","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uncle Ted has been training Ali in the art of herding on their Yorkshire farm, which happens to come very handy when the zombie\u00a0apocalypse\u00a0arrives on their doorstep! Zombie dog combines strategic coordination and timing with puzzle solving and comedic physics-based mayhem through its unique zombie herding mechanic. Travelling across country, coast and town Ali and their dog must combine their herding skills with a variety of environmental\u00a0traps and zombie mashing mechanics to dispatch the horde.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gain style points and complete challenges to earn \u2018bones\u2019 to spend on the skills tree.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect additional pickups to gain trophies for the farmhouse mantlepiece.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Perfect your timing in order to rise up to \u2018top dog\u2019 on the leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574550/extras/ZDog_Rolling.gif?t=1741888168\" />\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Key Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is played by using traditional sheepdog commands \u2013 minutes to learn, but a lifetime to master!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strategic mayhem, dark humour, Yorkshire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Framed by a graphic novel style narrative.</p>","developers":["Brickmouse"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"h